  "description": "Rearrange a binary search tree in-order so that the leftmost node becomes the root and every node has no left child, only a right child.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. let dummy = new Node(0)\n2. let prev = dummy\n3. function inorder(node) {\n4.   if (!node) return\n5.   inorder(node.left)\n6.   node.left = null\n7.   prev.right = node\n8.   prev = node\n9.   inorder(node.right)\n10. }\n11. inorder(root)\n12. return dummy.right",
